Runtime dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Wizard's Brush depends on third-party packages that are downloaded at install
time and are not redistributed here. Their licences are their own; see uv.lock
and frontend/package-lock.json for the exact resolved set.

Model weights are downloaded at run time from their respective publishers and
are NOT covered by this licence. Several carry their own terms, including the
CreativeML Open RAIL-M family, which restrict use in ways Apache-2.0 does not.
Read the licence of any model you download.
